---
name: org-plan
description: Activate whenever the user mentions an org plan, org-plan, Org-mode plan, or Gestalt, including questions, drafting and revisions. Write detailed Org implementation plans with L1/L2 milestones, dependencies, tests and acceptance criteria. Plan writing only; no implementation or Gestalt runtime management.
